(DemPronoun | [бокьара<PRON>:бокьара]) [>:>] OblMarker [>:>] SpatialCase

([сануда<PRON>:сануда] | [тIорда<PRON>:тIорда])
[тIорда<PRON>:тIорда] [>:>] ([<obl><h><pl>:ду] | [<obl><n><pl>:ди]) [>:>] CaseMarker ([>:>] SpatialCase)?
[тIорда<PRON>:тIорда] [>:>] ([<obl><h><pl>:ду] | [<obl><n><pl>:ди]) [>:>] SpatialCase

([<distr>>жи<PRON>><m>:жив>жи>в] | [<distr>>жи<PRON>><f>:жий>жи>й] | [<distr>>жи<PRON>><n>:жиб>жи>б]) ([>:>] SpatialCase)?
[<distr>>жи<PRON>><m>:жив>жи>в] [>:>] ([<obl><m>><erg>:щ>ти] | (OblMarker[m] [>:>] ([<gen>:б] | CaseMarker[-erg,-gen]))) ([>:>] SpatialCase)?
[<distr>>жи<PRON>><f>:жий>жи>й] [>:>] ([<obl><f>><erg>:т>ти] | (OblMarker[f] [>:>] CaseMarker[-erg])) ([>:>] SpatialCase)?
[<distr>>жи<PRON>><n>:жиб>жи>б] [>:>] ([<obl><n>><erg>:т>ти] | (OblMarker[n] [>:>] CaseMarker[-erg])) ([>:>] SpatialCase)?

PATTERN SpatialCase
LocMarker ([<ess>:] | [<lat>:])
LocMarker[-cont] [>:>] DirMarker
LocMarker[cont] [>:>] DirMarker[-al,-trans]

LEXICON Pronoun
ден<PRON>:ден
мин<PRON>:мин
ище<PRON>:ище
илIе<PRON>:илIе
битте<PRON>:битте

LEXICON PronounObl
ден<PRON><obl>:ди
мин<PRON><obl>:ду
ище<PRON>><obl>:ищ>и
илIе<PRON>><obl>:илI>и
битте<PRON>><obl>:битт>и

LEXICON IntPronoun
э<PRON>:э[com]
э<PRON><obl><m>:лълъе[pers]
э<PRON><obl><f>:лълъе[pers]
э<PRON><obl><n>:лълъун[n]
инкьассу<PRON>:инкьассу[adj]
чаму<PRON>:чаму[adj]
интто<PRON>:интто[st]

LEXICON DemPronoun
гьа<PRON>:гьа
гьу<PRON>:гьу
гьада<PRON>:гьада
гьудо<PRON>:гьудо
гье<PRON>:гье
гьо<PRON>:гьо
э<PRON>><which>:э>губа

LEXICON ClassMarker
<m>:в[m]
<f>:й[f]
<n>:б[n]
<h><pl>:бе[pl]
<n><pl>:ре[pl]

LEXICON OblMarker
<obl><m>:щу[m]
<obl><f>:лълъи[f]
<obl><n>:лълъи[n]
<obl><h><pl>:рду[hpl]
<obl><n><pl>:рди[npl]

LEXICON LocMarker
<sup>:ла
<cont>:чIу[cont]
<in>:о
<inter>:лIи
<apud>:ха
<ad>:хъи
<place>:алда

LEXICON DirMarker
<elat>:ру
<allat>:ху[al]
<translat>:руху[trans]
<translat>:риди[trans]
<translat>:руди[trans]
<translat>:рикьи[trans]

LEXICON CaseMarker
<erg>:ди[erg]
<gen>:лIи[gen]
<dat>:лъи[dat]
<aff>:ра[aff]
